# ==============================================================================
# ENROUTE FRONTEND (VITE + REACT) ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ==============================================================================

# Backend API Base URL (without trailing slash, WITHOUT /api suffix)
#
# For local development: leave UNSET — Vite automatically proxies /api → http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# For production (Vercel deployment connecting to Railway backend):
# This variable is REQUIRED. Without it all API calls fail with 405 (Vercel intercepts them).
#
# Set this in your Vercel project → Settings → Environment Variables → Production:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://<your-project>.up.railway.app
#
# Do NOT include /api at the end — the frontend appends it automatically.
# Do NOT use the Vercel URL here — that would send API calls back to the frontend.
#
# Both variable names are accepted (VITE_API_URL is checked first):
# VITE_API_URL=https://<your-project>.up.railway.app
# VITE_API_BASE=https://<your-project>.up.railway.app
